# Run r1102b slice 1, rerun R: the slice-1 rows that failed on batch faults (perf/runs/r1102b/s1/judged.md, "Batch
# fixes" and "Rerun"), fixed. Same world and srv as Boot A (s1_setup.md: group A superflat, level s1a, probes of Boot A
# in srv/kubejs/server_scripts). Re-copy tools/vintage_probe/vintage_probe.js to srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_vtd_probe.js
# before the boot (alias of creativebrewing: ids, Turnip Juice pot id).
# Every world row re-captures H from the s1home marker (forceloaded chunks persist in s1a). Bots of run 1 keep their
# starter-kit marker, so no kit arrives; each row still removes and clears its bot.
# Rows SQ-FDB-05 / -07 edit config/farmersdelight-ce-common.toml and wait for Forge's watcher line
# "Config file farmersdelight-ce-common.toml changed" in logs/debug.log (run 1 has none: the watcher never fired, so
# the shell step FAILs the row if it stays silent for 20 s). Order: data rows, probes, world rows, toml rows last.
pace 2

## SQ-CNS-02 | Comfort / Nourishment on eight foods
> zq food farmersdelight:noodle_soup
> zq food farmersdelight:beef_stew
> zq food farmersdelight:bone_broth
> zq food farmersdelight:dog_food
> zq food minecraft:golden_carrot
> zq food minecraft:enchanted_golden_apple
> zq food delightful:chunkwich
> zq food delightful:azalea_tea
expect food farmersdelight:noodle_soup: .*farmersdelight:nourishment amp 0 4800t
expect food farmersdelight:beef_stew: .*farmersdelight:comfort amp 0 4800t
reject food farmersdelight:bone_broth: .*(comfort|nourishment)
expect food farmersdelight:dog_food: .*farmersdelight:comfort amp 0 1200t
expect food minecraft:golden_carrot: .*farmersdelight:nourishment amp 0 2400t
expect food minecraft:enchanted_golden_apple: .*farmersdelight:nourishment amp 0 4800t
expect food minecraft:enchanted_golden_apple: .*minecraft:absorption
reject food delightful:chunkwich: .*nourishment
reject food delightful:azalea_tea: .*(comfort|nourishment)
reject not a food|\[zq\] error

